{
  "bodyHash": "UdNBqCCGt6c=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">理论上，这个模组支持<strong>所有</strong>模组加载器！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">介绍</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">在Minecraft 1.19及更新版本中，如果没有任何存档，点击“单人游戏”按钮时，Minecraft会<strong>自动打开“创建新世界”界面</strong>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">如果加载了大量模组，上述过程可能会非常缓慢，导致误触此按钮的用户不得不等待漫长的几秒钟。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">这个模组让Minecraft在没有任何存档时，<strong>显示一个空的世界选择列表界面</strong>，就像1.19之前的版本那样。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">演示</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">当你点“单人游戏”时却没有任何存档：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">没有安装模组时：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/743/151/2023-10-14_23.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"209\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">安装了此模组后：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/743/152/2023-10-14_23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">注意</span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">你<strong><span style=\"color:#9c0\">完全可以将</span></strong>此模组加入你的整合包；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">本项目遵循<strong>Nova Relay License 1.0</strong>。</span></li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
